            "text": "<h2>Corporate Gift Boxes From Charlotte's Sunflour Baking Company</h2>\n<p>Corporate gifts do not have to be forgettable. Sunflour Baking Company's corporate gift boxes are built around scratch-made baked goods from our Charlotte, NC bakeries: real food, made the right way, packaged for the person on the receiving end.</p>\n<p>Our corporate gift boxes draw from the products that have made Sunflour a Charlotte staple since 2009: hand-layered <a href=\"/collections/cake-jars\">cake jars</a>, rich brownies, <a href=\"/collections/cookie-gifts\">cookie assortments</a>, and pastry pouches. Everything is baked in small batches without artificial preservatives, packaged for safe transit, and ready to ship directly to individual addresses or a central office location.</p>\n<h3>Bulk Orders, Charlotte Pickup, and Custom Options</h3>\n<p>We accommodate bulk corporate orders with flexible lead times. Charlotte-area businesses can arrange local pickup from any of our five locations. Whether it is a holiday gift program, client appreciation campaign, or employee recognition send, our team can handle the logistics.</p>\n<p>Custom packaging and branded inserts are available for select orders. Contact us to discuss options and lead times before placing a large order so we can make sure everything is ready when you need it.</p>\n<h3>Why Companies Choose Sunflour</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Nationwide shipping with careful packaging for perishables</li>\n<li>Baked fresh to order in small batches, no artificial preservatives</li>\n<li>Bulk pricing available for large orders</li>\n<li>Charlotte pickup at five locations</li>\n<li>Vegan and gluten-friendly options available</li>\n</ul>"
